     <h2>About QuickNotes</h2>
        <p>
        QuickNotes is a lightweight web application designed to
        helpyou organize thoughts instantly without distraction. 
        It simplifies daily note-taking so you can focus on building projects and tracking key tasks.
      </p>

<section>
    <h3>How to use QuickNotes</h3>
    <ol>
    <li>Type your note into the input box on the Home page.</li>
<li>Click the "Add Note" button to save it to your list.</li>
    <li>Review your note count and list items anytime.</li>
        </ol>
     </section>

      <section>
        <h3>Features</h3>
         <ul>
    <li>Fast and minimalist interface</li>
        <li>Instant task creation</li>
          <li>Clean standards-compliant layout</li>
            </ul>
    </section>

